flowchart TD
    WRITE[local write] --> OPT[optimistic Room + outbox]
    OPT --> ONLINE{online?}
    ONLINE -->|no| WAIT[wait - usable offline]
    ONLINE -->|yes| PUSH[push idempotent]
    PUSH --> ACK{server ok?}
    ACK -->|yes| SYNCED[mark SYNCED]
    ACK -->|retryable| RETRY[WorkManager retry]
    ACK -->|rejected| FAIL[mark FAILED -> surface/rollback]
    PULL[pull delta] --> RESOLVE[conflict policy Ch 33] --> ROOM[reconcile]
